        <headline>Beach Hazards Statement issued September 24 at 3:09AM CDT until September 24 at 1:00PM CDT by NWS Milwaukee/Sullivan WI</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Life threatening waves of 3 to 5 feet and dangerous
currents are expected.

* WHERE...Sheboygan, Ozaukee, Milwaukee, Racine and Kenosha
Counties.

* WHEN...Through early Thursday afternoon.

* IMPACTS...Dangerous swimming conditions are expected due to
high waves and onshore winds.
</description>
        <instruction>Stay out of the water and away from dangerous areas like piers
and breakwalls.  Strong structural and longshore currents are
expected.  Rip currents are possible.</instruction>
